  "decision_conditions": [
    "CAR FREE DEVELOPMENT: All future occupiers of the residential units hereby approved shall not be eligible to obtain an on street residents parking permit except:\r\ni) In the case of disabled persons; \r\nii) In the case of units designated in this planning permission as 'non car free'; or \r\niii) In the case of the resident who is an existing holder of a residents parking permit issued by the London Borough of Islington and has held the permit for a period of at least one year. \r\n\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development remains car free in accordance with policy T6 of the London Plan 2021 and policy T3 of the Islington Local Plan: Strategic and Development Management Policies 2023."
